  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\">\n   <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex gap-2\">\n     <div class=\"relative flex w-10 shrink-0 justify-center self-stretch\">\n      <div class=\"relative z-10\">\n       <a class=\"\" href=\"https://x.com/lemire\"> \n        <div class=\"shrink-0 overflow-hidden bg-neutral-300 rounded-full size-10 transition duration-200 hover:brightness-90\">\n         <img alt=\"user avatar\" class=\"size-full object-cover\" draggable=\"false\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"40px\" src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2070145724390535168/x9MGWOxQ_normal.jpg\" srcset=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2070145724390535168/x9MGWOxQ_mini.jpg 24w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2070145724390535168/x9MGWOxQ_normal.jpg 48w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2070145724390535168/x9MGWOxQ_bigger.jpg 73w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2070145724390535168/x9MGWOxQ_x96.jpg 96w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2070145724390535168/x9MGWOxQ_reasonably_small.jpg 128w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2070145724390535168/x9MGWOxQ_200x200.jpg 200w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2070145724390535168/x9MGWOxQ_400x400.jpg 400w\">\n        </div> \n       </a>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-2\">\n       <div class=\"overflow-hidden flex-col items-start gap-0 min-w-0\">\n        <div class=\"flex max-w-full shrink-0 items-center gap-1\">\n         <a class=\"font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-all text-text line-clamp-1 text-body font-bold hover:underline\" href=\"https://x.com/lemire\">Daniel Lemire</a>\n         <div class=\"shrink-0\">\n          <div class=\"font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-text text-body font-normal\">\n           <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\">\n            <span role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Verified account\" class=\"flex cursor-pointer items-center\" type=\"button\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\"></span>\n           </div>\n          </div>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex min-w-0 items-center gap-2\">\n         <a class=\"font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-gray-700 no-underline [font-feature-settings:'ss01'] line-clamp-1 text-body font-normal\" href=\"https://x.com/lemire\">@lemire</a>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n       <div class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1 whitespace-nowrap\">\n        <button class=\"gap-1 inline-flex items-center border border-solid font-bold has-[svg:only-child]:px-0 transition disabled:pointer-events-none focus-visible:outline disabled:opacity-50 justify-center bg-background rounded-full text-text h-8 min-w-8 px-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-[1.125rem] text-subtext1 hover:bg-mix-current hover:bg-mix-amount-10 active:bg-mix-current active:bg-mix-amount-15 focus-visible:bg-mix-current focus-visible:bg-mix-amount-10 outline-current -my-2 size-8 min-w-8 shrink-0 border-transparent bg-transparent p-0 text-gray-700 hover:bg-blue-500/10 hover:text-blue-500 focus-visible:outline-blue-500\" aria-label=\"More\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\"></button>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\">\n     <div dir=\"auto\" class=\"font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-text text-body font-normal\">\n      <span class=\"font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit\">Xiaomi is the Chinese tech giant. Their phones compete with iPhones. Their new CPU roughly matches Apple cores on single threaded tasks, and is much faster in multithreaded execution. Of course, Apple may soon announce their next processor, so this edge may not last long. And you may find it it difficult to find a phone with the next CPU (Xring O3). But the new Xiaomi processor is worth discussing further as it reveals an important trend. The chip has a lot of cache (44 MB in total). It is more than most laptop CPUs. If you have an Intel processor in your laptop, chances are good that you have less cache. The biggest cores on the the Xring O3 are the C1-Ultra. C1-Ultra really powerful cores. They support SME2 (Scalable Matrix Extension 2) for matrix/AI acceleration, SVE2 for data parallelism (SIMD). It is astonishingly wide, with 21 execution ports, six of which support SIMD operations (128 bits). This is more execution ports than you have on your Intel/AMD processor. The AMD Zen 5 has the upper hand because it can do 4x512-bit but 6x128-bit is the best you can do on an ARM chip as far as I know. So the trend is clear. We are getting cores that are massively parallel in terms of the number of execution units. We get better SIMD (more units) and many more units capable of doing arithmetic. This means that you can do many, many independent additions or multiplications per cycle. And much more cache. This is where all the transistors go.</span>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"relative overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 rounded-md\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1.235223160434258\">\n      <div class=\"relative h-full w-full\">\n       <div inert class=\"h-full w-full\">\n        <a aria-label=\"Image\" class=\"block h-full w-full cursor-zoom-in appearance-none border-none bg-transparent p-0 text-inherit\" href=\"https://x.com/lemire/status/2091894299289874926/photo/1\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"w-full\" loading=\"eager\" fetchpriority=\"high\" src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQfmx0UWoAAvbt6?format=webp&amp;name=medium\" srcset=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQfmx0UWoAAvbt6?format=webp&amp;name=small 680w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQfmx0UWoAAvbt6?format=webp&amp;name=medium 1200w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQfmx0UWoAAvbt6?format=webp&amp;name=large 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) calc(100vw - 80px), 600px\"></a>\n       </div>\n       <a aria-label=\"View media\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-10\" href=\"https://x.com/lemire/status/2091894299289874926/photo/1\"></a>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"transition-colors focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-500 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 overflow-hidden cursor-pointer hover:bg-gray-100/50\" data-href=\"/UniverseIce/status/2091770325927411955\" role=\"link\" tabindex=\"0\">\n      <article>\n       <div class=\"flex p-3 flex-col gap-1\">\n        <div class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-1\">\n         <div class=\"flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1\">\n          <a class=\"\" href=\"https://x.com/UniverseIce\"> \n           <div class=\"shrink-0 overflow-hidden bg-neutral-300 rounded-full size-6 transition duration-200 hover:brightness-90\">\n            <img alt=\"user avatar\" class=\"size-full object-cover\" draggable=\"false\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"24px\" src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1991080858565107712/h4zsDLgA_normal.jpg\" srcset=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1991080858565107712/h4zsDLgA_mini.jpg 24w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1991080858565107712/h4zsDLgA_normal.jpg 48w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1991080858565107712/h4zsDLgA_bigger.jpg 73w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1991080858565107712/h4zsDLgA_x96.jpg 96w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1991080858565107712/h4zsDLgA_reasonably_small.jpg 128w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1991080858565107712/h4zsDLgA_200x200.jpg 200w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1991080858565107712/h4zsDLgA_400x400.jpg 400w\">\n           </div> \n          </a>\n          <div class=\"shrink flex items-center text-gray-700 [&amp;&gt;span:not(:empty)~span:not(:empty)]:before:content-['·'] [&amp;&gt;span:not(:empty)~span:not(:empty)]:before:px-1 [&amp;&gt;span:not(:empty)~span:not(:empty)]:before:shrink-0 min-w-0 overflow-hidden\">