n multi-core.</span>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n       <div class=\"mx-auto relative overflow-hidden\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1\">\n        <div class=\"relative h-full w-full\">\n         <div inert class=\"h-full w-full\">\n          <a aria-label=\"Image\" class=\"block h-full w-full cursor-zoom-in appearance-none border-none bg-transparent p-0 text-inherit\" href=\"https://x.com/UniverseIce/status/2091770325927411955/photo/1\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"w-full\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQd2A-QaUAADV1d?format=webp&amp;name=medium\" srcset=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQd2A-QaUAADV1d?format=webp&amp;name=small 680w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQd2A-QaUAADV1d?format=webp&amp;name=medium 1200w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQd2A-QaUAADV1d?format=webp&amp;name=large 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) calc(100vw - 80px), 600px\"></a>\n         </div>\n         <a aria-label=\"View media\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-10\" href=\"https://x.com/UniverseIce/status/2091770325927411955/photo/1\"></a>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </article>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"shrink flex items-center text-gray-700 [&amp;&gt;span:not(:empty)~span:not(:empty)]:before:content-['·'] [&amp;&gt;span:not(:empty)~span:not(:empty)]:before:px-1 [&amp;&gt;span:not(:empty)~span:not(:empty)]:before:shrink-0\">\n      <span class=\"contents\"><a id=\"_R_qhpipid4j6_\" data-state=\"closed\" class=\"font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-gray-700 text-body font-normal hover:underline inline-flex w-fit\" href=\"https://x.com/lemire/status/2091894299289874926\">2:24 PM · Aug 24, 2026</a></span><span class=\"contents\"><a data-state=\"closed\" class=\"font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-gray-700 text-subtext1 font-normal hover:underline inline-flex items-center gap-1\" href=\"https://x.com/lemire/status/2091894299289874926\"><span class=\"font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-text text